  <h2>The Future of Disposable Email and Digital Privacy</h2>

  <p>
    The future of disposable email is converging with edge computing, serverless architectures, and advanced privacy technologies. In the coming years, we can expect:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Instant AI Summarization & Safe Link Extraction:</strong> Next-generation inboxes that automatically isolate security codes and verification URLs without rendering tracking pixels or malicious scripts.</li>
    <li><strong>Decentralized & Zero-Knowledge Inboxes:</strong> Fully client-side decrypted ephemeral mailboxes where even the server host cannot read message contents.</li>
    <li><strong>Granular Lifetime Controls:</strong> Temporary mailboxes with self-destruct timers ranging from 60 seconds to custom multi-day windows.</li>
  </ul>

